yout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Cows are made of milk.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/b/b9/Cows_are_made_of_milk..png/revision/latest?cb=20250918221157\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Cows are made of milk.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/b/b9/Cows_are_made_of_milk..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250918221157\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/b/b9/Cows_are_made_of_milk..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250918221157 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/b/b9/Cows_are_made_of_milk..png/revision/latest?cb=20250918221157 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Cows are made of milk.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Cows_are_made_of_milk..png\" data-image-name=\"Cows are made of milk..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">20</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\">Reece Shearsmith</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/9_x_7.\" title=\"9 x 7.\">9 x 7.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thompson.\" title=\"Thompson.\">Thompson.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Cows are made of milk.</b></i> is the second episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_20\" title=\"Series 20\">Series 20</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 18 September 2025. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\">Reece Shearsmith</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Cows_are_made_of_milk.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\">Ania Magliano</a> jumbles her words while explaining why she thought the wet teeth were a small cow in the <a href=\"/wiki/Identify_Alex%27s_five_things\" title=\"Identify Alex&#39;s five things\">Identify Alex's five things</a> task, saying \"cows are made of milk\", the episode's title. The title card shows a task hanging in a tree, which doesn't seem to reference any task in particular.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Cows_are_made_of_milk.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 0 5px 5px 5px;\">&#8220;\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.5;\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\">Reece Shearsmith</a>'s hand emerging from inside a bag. <a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</a> rotating around a hill of flour. And <a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\">Maisie Adam</a>'s mouth poking through <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a>' nose. These are just some of the arresting images that feature in this episode. Meanwhile, <a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\">Phil Ellis</a> finds something surprising inside a fake fish, <a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\">Ania Magliano</a> makes a startling revelation and Little <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> introduces Little Little Alex Horne to the world.</i>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 5px 5px -3px 5px;\">&#8221;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\">- British Comedy Guide\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><small><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.comedy.co.uk/tv/taskmaster/episodes/20/2/\">[1]</a></small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ania_Magliano\" title=\"Ania Magliano\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ania Magliano</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Maisie_Adam\" title=\"Maisie Adam\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Maisie Adam</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Ellis\" title=\"Phil Ellis\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Phil Ellis</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Reece_Shearsmith\" title=\"Reece Shearsmith\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Reece Shearsmith</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sanjeev_Bhaskar\" title=\"Sanjeev Bhaskar\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sanjeev Bhaskar</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_object_that_is_hardest_to_describe\" title=\"The object that is hardest to describe\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The object that is hardest to describe.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Identify_Alex%27s_five_things\" title=\"Identify Alex&#39;s five things\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Identify Alex's five things. You may only use one sense. If you choose hearing, you get five points per item; smell, four points; taste, three points; touch, two points; sight, one point.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><a href=\"/wiki/Remove_the_most_flour_from_the_tray_without_touching_flour_with_your_hands\" title=\"Remove the most flour from the tray without touching flour with your hands\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Write a superpower on the little clipboard.\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Team:</b> Each team member must hook a duck, silently read the duck's superpower, then use that superpower for the next task in 10 minutes from now. At no point may you tell your teammates your superpower.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">DQ\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">DQ\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">DQ\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">DQ\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Team:</b> Remove the most flour from the tray without touching flour with your hands or moving Little Little Alex Horne. If Little Little Alex Horne moves at any point, you are disqualified. You must take it in turns to remove flour, and you must employ your superpowers.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus</b> for the contestant who employs their superpower most effectively.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small><b>1</b></small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Take_the_most_surprising_thing_out_of_this_bag\" title=\"Take the most surprising thing out of this bag\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Take the most surprising thing out of this bag.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guess_how_many_things_the_Taskmaster%27s_assistant_has_on_him\" title=\"Guess how many things the Taskmaster&#39;s assistant has on him\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Guess how many things the Taskmaster's assistant has on him. Worst answer is eliminated.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus</b> if you are exactly 10 out at any time.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small><b>5</b></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>9\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">22\n</td>\n<td>9\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Cows_are_made_of_milk.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster\"><i>Cows are made of milk.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-